    skos:prefLabel 'Micron Instruments MP40C-2000G pressure transducer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A flush mountable pressure transducer MP40 model, configured to performance specification \'C\'  and header option \'G\' (gage), depth-rated to 2000 psi. The instrument was manufactured by Micron Instruments (also operating as Piezo-Metrics).'@en ;
